    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-474207"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387">
                    陈奇
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">14/一月/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-474207"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL247819https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL247819at13%2FJan%2F267%3A02PM%2Clasteditedby%E9%99%88%E5%A5%87https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F557058%3A1e1c47af84e443b88bc448b51d054387at13%2FJan%2F267%3A26PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-47819" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-47819</a> at 13/Jan/26 7:02 PM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">陈奇</a> at 13/Jan/26 7:26 PM</h5>

<h3><a name="%E7%8E%B0%E8%B1%A1%E6%8F%8F%E8%BF%B0%EF%BC%9A"></a>现象描述：</h3>

<p>这个机房的飞腾5000C节点连接着vga显示器启动，启动后显示器可以正常显示prompt，也可以正常进行操作，但是拔掉显示器的vga线然后再插回去，显示器就会黑屏，看不到prompt，键盘工作正常，重启操作系统后，显示可以恢复正常，进行同样操作后会稳定复现。</p>

<p>整个过程中系统运行正常，带外远程控制、ssh可正常连接节点。现场机房同型号同配置节点运行统信os，进行相同操作后一切正常。</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-474208"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387">
                    陈奇
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">14/一月/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-474208"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL247819https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL247819at13%2FJan%2F267%3A21PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-47819" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-47819</a> at 13/Jan/26 7:21 PM</h5>

<p>查看现场一台处于复现状态的es节点，可以看到显示设备为Device 'Phytium Technology DCController <span class="error">&#91;E2000 Series&#93;</span>'（1db7:dc3e），但是没有显示所使用的驱动：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387853" alt="lspci_display_01-20260113-071149.png" width="875" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387854" alt="lspci_display_02-20260113-071204.png" width="836" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>这个设备的驱动看起来不在上游代码树中：</p>

<p><a href="https://linux-hardware.org/?id=pci:1db7-dc3e" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://linux-hardware.org/?id=pci:1db7-dc3e</a> </p>



<p>另外在dmesg中看到如下日志：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387849" alt="hwirq_mismatch_during_boot-20260113-072159.png" width="807" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>可以在看到启动初期efifb正常加载，但随后设备ACPI0013:00的acpi_ged探测失败，目前不清是什么设备。此外，没有在dmesg中看到其他可疑点。</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-474209"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387">
                    陈奇
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">14/一月/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-474209"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL247819https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL247819at13%2FJan%2F267%3A25PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-47819" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-47819</a> at 13/Jan/26 7:25 PM</h5>

<p>从现场拿到同型号同配置节点运行统信os内的一些信息，一些可疑的差异如下：</p>

<ul>
	<li>cmdline中特别设置了video=VGA-1:640x480-32@60me，</li>
</ul>


<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>BOOT_IMAGE=/vmlinuz-4.19.90-2403.3.0.0270.95.d.5.uel20.aarch64 root=/dev/mapper/uos-root ro crashkernel=auto rd.lvm.lv=uos/root video=VGA-1:640x480-32@60me lse=on cgroup_disable=io rhgb quiet elevator=none console=tty0 iommu.passthrough=on</pre>
</div></div>

<blockquote><ul>
	<li>video=: This is the parameter prefix indicating a video mode configuration.</li>
	<li>VGA-1: Specifies the display connector or output port (e.g., a VGA port labeled as the first one). Common connectors include HDMI-A-1, DP-1, or LVDS-1, depending on hardware.</li>
	<li>640x480: Sets the horizontal and vertical resolution to 640 pixels wide by 480 pixels high, which is a low-resolution standard mode often used for compatibility or troubleshooting.</li>
	<li>-32: Defines the color depth (bits per pixel) as 32-bit, enabling true color with alpha channel support (typically 8 bits each for red, green, blue, and alpha).</li>
	<li>@60: Sets the refresh rate to 60 Hz, which is a common default for smooth display without flicker.</li>
	<li>m: Enables calculation of margins, which adjusts for overscan on certain monitors or TVs to ensure the image fits properly within the visible area.</li>
	<li>e: Forces the output to be enabled, ensuring this display is active even if the kernel might otherwise disable it.</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>

<ul>
	<li>显示设备的驱动是phytium_display_pci（phytium_dc_drm）</li>
</ul>


<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
