            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL247819https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL247819at14%2FJan%2F2610%3A52AM%2Clasteditedby%E9%99%88%E5%A5%87https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F557058%3A1e1c47af84e443b88bc448b51d054387at14%2FJan%2F2610%3A54AM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-47819" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-47819</a> at 14/Jan/26 10:52 AM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">陈奇</a> at 14/Jan/26 10:54 AM</h5>

<p>再登录到现场环境，查看dmesg中并无drm系统的相关打印，修改内核启动参数，去掉“nomodeset”，并增加“video=VGA-1:640x480-32@60me”，然后进行重启。</p>

<p>重启后lspci中{{1db7:dc3e}}设备依然没有显示对应kmod，dmesg中依然没有drm系统相关打印，请现场做复现操作，故障已然复现。查看/dev下fb设备仅有efifb驱动对应的fb0:</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387848" alt="dmesg_drm_empty-20260113-124340.png" width="325" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387846" alt="dev_fb0-20260113-124517.png" width="338" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>



<p>查看统信系统dmesg，可以看到有大量drm相关打印，且对应模块为phytium_dc_drm：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387847" alt="dmesg_drm-20260113-142320.png" width="916" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>另外看到efifb加载过程和es节点一样，且后面也有irq mismatch，但未见acpi_ged报错：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387850" alt="irq_mismatch-20260113-142426.png" width="903" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>phytium_display_pci驱动对应如下In-tree ko中：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387851" alt="kmod-20260113-142546.png" width="916" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>尝试将此kmod移至es节点，不能直接depmod：</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387852" alt="kmod-20260113-143758.png" width="899" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-474212"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                id="word_commented_557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387">
                    陈奇
                </a>

