            [
                <font color="#336699">14/一月/26</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-474212"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL247819https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL247819at14%2FJan%2F261%3A08PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-47819" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-47819</a> at 14/Jan/26 1:08 PM</h5>

<p>通过项目经理和代理商对接服务器厂商，厂商表示飞腾方面反馈了3个文件如下：</p>

<p><span class="nobr"><a href="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387844" title="0001-xorg-ast-ft-bmc-5000c.patch attached to ECS-7812" data-attachment-type="file" data-attachment-name="0001-xorg-ast-ft-bmc-5000c.patch" data-media-services-type="file" data-media-services-id="b760e4e3-591a-4236-934a-99764d14af2c" rel="noreferrer">0001-xorg-ast-ft-bmc-5000c.patch<sup><img class="rendericon" src="/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span><br/>
<span class="nobr"><a href="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387855" title="飞腾平台开启SMMU操作指南v1.1.docx attached to ECS-7812" data-attachment-type="file" data-attachment-name="飞腾平台开启SMMU操作指南v1.1.docx" data-media-services-type="file" data-media-services-id="03c69795-76dc-4f68-939c-a2efb4b5259a" rel="noreferrer">飞腾平台开启SMMU操作指南v1.1.docx<sup><img class="rendericon" src="/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span><br/>
<span class="nobr"><a href="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/387845" title="0925.zip attached to ECS-7812" data-attachment-type="file" data-attachment-name="0925.zip" data-media-services-type="file" data-media-services-id="331f4280-fa29-4774-ba63-33751f552a69" rel="noreferrer">0925.zip<sup><img class="rendericon" src="/images/icons/link_attachment_7.gif" height="7" width="7" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/></sup></a></span></p>

<p>其中doc文档看起来与本问题无关；</p>

<p>0001-xorg-ast-ft-bmc-5000c.patch看起来似乎与bmc有关，但是patch中没有任何说明；</p>

<p>0925.zip中有针对4.19、5.10、5.15、6.1、6.6内核的大量patch，但是没有基于4.18的patch，另外这些patch涉及范围大大超出drm范畴，并且没有任何patch说明。</p>



<p>基于这些材料暂时无法展开内部推进。</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-474213"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387"
