        <tr id="comment-body-474213"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL247819https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL247819at14%2FJan%2F261%3A18PM%2Clasteditedby%E9%99%88%E5%A5%87https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F557058%3A1e1c47af84e443b88bc448b51d054387at14%2FJan%2F261%3A27PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-47819" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-47819</a> at 14/Jan/26 1:18 PM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/557058:1e1c47af-84e4-43b8-8bc4-48b51d054387" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">陈奇</a> at 14/Jan/26 1:27 PM</h5>

<p>翻阅openeuler库，看到针对飞腾X100以及E2000设备增加驱动的issue是：<a href="https://gitee.com/openeuler/kernel/issues/I7QJML" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://gitee.com/openeuler/kernel/issues/I7QJML</a></p>

<p>对应的pr是<a href="https://gitee.com/openeuler/kernel/pulls/2588" title="smart-link" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">https://gitee.com/openeuler/kernel/pulls/2588</a>  </p>

<p>但是这个pr是merge在4.19.90-2311.1.0内核代码里，尚不清楚能否合并在4.18代码树中。</p>

<p>另外，openeuler-6.6包含此模块：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>[root@node-1 disk]# ll /usr/lib/modules/6.6.0-85.0.0.79.es9_7_dange.aarch64/kernel/drivers/gpu/drm/phytium/phytium-dc-drm.ko
-rw-r--r-- 1 root 6595777  9月 8日 17:23 /usr/lib/modules/6.6.0-85.0.0.79.es9_7_dange.aarch64/kernel/drivers/gpu/drm/phytium/phytium-dc-drm.ko</pre>
</div></div>
        </td></tr>
